{"run_id": "run_04310676ce6a", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s01_cooperative", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。请问你今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "可以，没问题。不过我想问一下，如果今天配送不完会怎样？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "如果今天没有完成约定单量，合同和后续派单可能会受影响。不过只要按时上线，一般都能完成。你愿意今天开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我愿意配送。还有什么需要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "太好了！注意安全，另外报名名额是按排名分配的，尽量少拒单、取消和超时，这样能保持好排名。祝你配送顺利！"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢站长，我会注意的。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，有需要随时联系。再见！"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "accepted", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_04310676ce6a", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s02_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。什么事？我正忙着呢，长话短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，简单说：今天飞毛腿合同已生效，需要你完成配送任务，否则合同和派单可能受影响。你能上线吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "今天真没时间，能不能改天？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解。但合同今天生效，如果无法配送，名额可能被占用。要不我预约个时间再联系你？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "行吧，那晚上再打给我。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我记下了，晚上再联系你。再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 6, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "preferred_time": "later_today"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_04310676ce6a", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_003", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s03_reject", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天飞毛腿合同已经生效了，你这边今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "今天不太想跑，有点累。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解，不过这个合同是今天生效的，如果今天不完成约定单量，可能会影响后续的合同和派单。你看能不能克服一下？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "真的不想跑，今天休息一天。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我理解。那能方便说一下具体原因吗？是身体不舒服还是其他事情？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "就是累了，想歇一天。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我记录一下。不过提醒你，飞毛腿名额是按排名分配的，如果今天不跑，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同也可能受影响。你确定今天不跑了吗？"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "确定，今天不跑了。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那我记录一下。如果后续想跑了，随时可以上线。注意安全，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 9, "tool_name": "record_rejection", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "骑手表示累了，想休息一天"}, "result": {"status": "rejected", "rejection_id": "virtual_rejection_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_04310676ce6a", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_004", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s04_faq_exit", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。合同生效了？那我想问一下，如果我不想干了，怎么退出？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "理解您的顾虑。退出的话，需要在前一天指定时间前，通过App的飞毛腿报名入口取消，次日生效。您今天合同刚生效，建议先试试配送，如果确实不合适再退出。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "那如果我不配送会有什么影响？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "如果今天不配送，合同和派单可能受影响，名额也可能被其他骑手占用。不过您今天刚生效，可以先跑跑看，有问题随时联系我。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "我担心完不成任务，有没有什么要求？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "单日合同需要完成约定单量，否则合同和派单可能受影响。多日合同需要每天达到约定单量。不过您今天刚开始，不用太担心，尽力就好。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "那完成多日合同有奖励吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "奖励以平台页面展示为准，我不能承诺固定收益。您可以在App上查看具体规则。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "好吧，那我今天先试试。不过如果中途有事不能连续配送怎么办？"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "如果无法连续配送，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也可能受影响。建议您尽量安排好时间。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我明白了。那我今天上线配送，注意安全对吧？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "是的，注意安全，减少拒单、取消和超时。报名名额按排名分配，好好表现。祝您今天顺利！"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "好的，谢谢站长，再见。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "再见，张师傅，有需要随时联系。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 3, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "如何退出飞毛腿"}, "result": {"answer": "如需退出飞毛腿，需要在前一天指定时间前，通过 App 的飞毛腿报名入口取消，次日生效。"}, "latency_ms": 50, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 5, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "单日合同有什么要求"}, "result": {"answer": "单日合同生效当天需要完成约定单量，否则合同和派单可能受影响。"}, "latency_ms": 45, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 6, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "完成多日合同有奖励吗"}, "result": {"answer": "奖励以平台页面展示为准，站长不能承诺固定收益。"}, "latency_ms": 40, "error_code": null}, {"turn": 8, "tool_name": "query_faq", "arguments": {"task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "question": "如果无法连续配送会怎样"}, "result": {"answer": "如果无法连续配送，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也可能受影响。"}, "latency_ms": 42, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "faq_answered", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "faq_answered", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "faq_answered", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "faq_answered", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "faq_answered", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_04310676ce6a", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_005", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s05_human_transfer", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天飞毛腿合同已经生效了，想确认一下你今天能不能上线配送？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "哎呀，我现在很忙，没时间听这些，你直接给我转人工客服吧。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，理解您的情况，我马上为您转接人工客服，请稍等。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "transfer_to_human", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "user_requested_human"}, "result": {"status": "transferred", "queue_id": "virtual_queue_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "transferred", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_04310676ce6a", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_006", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s06_complaint", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我，有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。请问你今天可以开始配送吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "哦，合同生效了？但我之前有个配送结算的问题还没解决，你们一直没给我处理好。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "非常抱歉给您带来困扰。您能具体说一下是什么结算问题吗？我这边先记录一下，帮您反馈处理。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "就是上个月有几单配送费没给我结算，我打过好几次电话了，一直没解决。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "我理解您的心情，这个问题确实不应该拖延。我马上帮您创建一个工单，安排专人跟进处理，您看可以吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "行吧，那你赶紧处理。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我已经记录了您的工单，编号是TK20231001，会尽快处理。另外，关于今天的飞毛腿合同，您看能否先上线配送？如果今天不完成约定单量，合同和后续派单可能会受影响。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "我今天心情不好，不想跑了。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "我理解，不过这个合同名额是按排名分配的，如果今天不跑，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续再报名就难了。您看能不能先跑几单？注意安全就好。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "那好吧，我下午上线跑几单。"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "太好了，谢谢张师傅！记得减少拒单、取消和超时，这样对您后续派单也有好处。如果有什么问题随时联系我。"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "好的，知道了。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "那就不打扰您了，祝您配送顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 6, "tool_name": "create_ticket", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "category": "complaint", "description": "骑手反馈上个月有几单配送费未结算，多次联系未解决"}, "result": {"status": "created", "ticket_id": "TK20231001"}, "latency_ms": 120, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "ticket_created", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
